  "interpretation": [
    "All3 S200 seeds meet the validation stable rule; own stable_step=0 reflects inherited L training, not training-free convergence. Best steps1800/700/600 and stops1900/1000/1000. Mean whole-parent-plus-stage elapsed1491.040281s.",
    "Sbest has test AbsRel0.086558335987 (SD0.000868839022), RMSE0.347744856934, delta1 .933080632111, F1 .470593624636, band .147853057457; Sfinal AbsRel .086450800083 and F1 .473914711083.",
    "Against actual Lbest parent, Sbest improves AbsRel (-.000518608, CI[-.000722809,-.000321167]), RMSE and boundary-band error in all3seeds, while F1 decreases in all3(-.010321881); delta1 difference includes zero. Sfinal retains similar tradeoff, though firstseed F1 improves slightly.",
    "Both S endpoints improve all5 metrics versus B0. Against Jbest, Sbest improves average AbsRel and F1, with RMSE/delta1/band intervals including zero; AbsRel seed signs mixed. Against Jfinal, Sfinal improves aggregate overall3 and F1 but not band.",
    "Sfinal versus Lfinal large mean F1 advantage is driven by L200112 endpoint edge loss; two other seeds have lower S F1. It is not evidence that adding F3 universally sharpens boundaries.",
    "After selected best, Sfinal slightly improves mean AbsRel and F1 on test; this does not change validation-selected best identities. Fixed examples show limited differences versus parent and both good/bad cases; no test-based tuning."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Sbest uses validation-selected residual weights on frozen samecount/sameseed Lbest. Sfinal-versus-Lfinal is a method-endpoint comparison, not the isolated added-residual effect; actual_parent_pairs always uses Lbest.",
    "All descriptive intervals condition on3trainingseeds and215testscenes without multiplecomparisoncorrection. Meanseed differences and signs retained; no test selection.",
    "All S seed-stability decisions come from validation. Ownstage0 does not mean zero total training: parent training and selection already occurred. Three-seed inference timings are observational and not a dedicatedbenchmark.",
    "Actualvisualreviewcovers only3fixedimages atseed320112 and bothendpoints; full654and all3seeds numerically evaluated."
  ]
